<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00-1.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00-1.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.25</p>
<p>higher. Top $57.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    57.50-57.75</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    56.50-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent 0.50-1.00 higher. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-450 lbs    46.00-46.50</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    48.00</p>
</text>
